        "steam_appid": 3813130,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/fa13ff09e7146780af89da9a16758923.avif?t=1766390861\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Blind Simulator' </strong>is a unique VR simulation game that lets you experience the world through the eyes of someone who is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin the game without vision, relying solely on a white cane to navigate your surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tapping the cane on the ground triggers a sonar-like effect, briefly revealing the shapes and objects in the nearby environment through visual echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.webp?t=1766390861\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.poster.webp?t=1766390861\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a safe and immersive virtual world, you’ll journey toward a hospital by taking buses or subways, crossing busy streets, and exploring unfamiliar locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this experience, players will learn how to perceive and interpret the unseen using senses beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a simulation, Blind Simulator delivers a powerful narrative that conveys the daily challenges and fears faced by people with visual impairments. It’s an emotionally resonant VR experience with educational value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey of discovering how to <strong>“see without seeing”</strong> through sound, vibration, and spatial awareness.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/fa13ff09e7146780af89da9a16758923.avif?t=1766390861\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Blind Simulator' </strong>is a unique VR simulation game that lets you experience the world through the eyes of someone who is blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin the game without vision, relying solely on a white cane to navigate your surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tapping the cane on the ground triggers a sonar-like effect, briefly revealing the shapes and objects in the nearby environment through visual echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.webp?t=1766390861\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813130/extras/2fede2880b3a6179e05e14b342460afd.poster.webp?t=1766390861\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a safe and immersive virtual world, you’ll journey toward a hospital by taking buses or subways, crossing busy streets, and exploring unfamiliar locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this experience, players will learn how to perceive and interpret the unseen using senses beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a simulation, Blind Simulator delivers a powerful narrative that conveys the daily challenges and fears faced by people with visual impairments. It’s an emotionally resonant VR experience with educational value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey of discovering how to <strong>“see without seeing”</strong> through sound, vibration, and spatial awareness.</p>",
        "short_description": "“Blind Simulator” is a unique VR simulation game where you explore the world without sight, using only a white cane. By experiencing the daily life of a visually impaired person, the game invites you to discover a new way of seeing through sound, vibration, and spatial awareness.",
